# Heavy assets — MUST live on R2, never in git / the Vercel bundle.
# Videos (2.6 GB total) and multi-MB test meshes. Small geojsons in
# public/generated (boundaries, roads, buildings, labels) stay committed
# because the map layers fetch them locally.
public/media/
public/generated/*.obj
public/generated/forge3d_test_terrain_meta.json
public/*.kmz
.env.local

